      "writtenOn": "2020-05-13T19:58:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "vSrcValid sounds like a good name for 5V or greater. That is basically what the current check does. I feel like we should add that now if we can since a lot of code is interested in that concept (probably even more than Safe5V)",
      "parentUuid": "0fef0268_0f5e407c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 112,
